<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/reserved-instances> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A billing discount, not a physical server: you commit to a specific instance configuration (instance type, Region, tenancy and platform) for a one- or three-year term, and matching On-Demand usage is billed at a reduced rate. Offered for Amazon EC2 and, as reserved DB instances, for Amazon RDS and Aurora." .
